                                "example_id": "600721b3-789c-449b-b40f-0115296f4a81",
                                "sense_id": "4761d430-d23c-3fb2-8da9-3081af88c28d",
                                "text": "Our sergeant did not, therefore, as might have been expected, retain the hale men to fight and send on the feeblings, but just the reverse; and the only disabled soldiers pushed forward were the few in the waggons […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "70bf68bb-ed99-493a-a924-48f288946062",
                                "sense_id": "4761d430-d23c-3fb2-8da9-3081af88c28d",
                                "text": "You are feeblings. I am your master. You can't bring a squeal out of me. You think it remarkable, for you know how easily you would squeal."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
